flowchart LR

    %% =====================================
    %% ADMIN CATALOG CREATION
    %% =====================================

    Admin[👨‍💼 Admin]

    Admin --> Category
    Admin --> Product
    Admin --> Attributes
    Admin --> Images

    Category[Product Categories]
    Product[Product]
    Attributes[Attributes]
    Images[Product Images]

    %% =====================================
    %% PRODUCT MODELING
    %% =====================================

    Product --> Variants

    Attributes --> Variants

    Variants[Product Variants]

    Variants --> Size
    Variants --> Color
    Variants --> SKU
    Variants --> Price

    Size[Size]
    Color[Color]
    SKU[SKU]
    Price[Price]

    %% =====================================
    %% INVENTORY
    %% =====================================

    Variants --> Inventory

    Inventory[Inventory Assignment]

    Inventory --> AvailableStock
    Inventory --> ReservedStock

    AvailableStock[Available Stock]
    ReservedStock[Reserved Stock]

    %% =====================================
    %% PUBLISHING FLOW
    %% =====================================

    Product --> Validation

    Validation[Catalog Validation]

    Validation --> Published

    Published[Published Product]

    %% =====================================
    %% DATABASE STORAGE
    %% =====================================

    Published --> MySQL

    MySQL[(MySQL)]

    Images --> S3

    S3[(AWS S3)]

    %% =====================================
    %% CACHE LAYER
    %% =====================================

    MySQL --> Redis

    Redis[(Redis Cache)]

    Redis --> ProductCache
    Redis --> CategoryCache

    ProductCache[Product Cache]
    CategoryCache[Category Cache]

    %% =====================================
    %% STOREFRONT REQUEST FLOW
    %% =====================================

    Customer[👤 Customer]

    Customer --> Storefront

    Storefront[Next.js Storefront]

    Storefront --> ProductAPI

    ProductAPI[Catalog API]

    ProductAPI --> Redis

    Redis -->|Cache Hit| Storefront

    ProductAPI -->|Cache Miss| MySQL

    MySQL --> Redis

    %% =====================================
    %% PRODUCT PAGE DATA
    %% =====================================

    Storefront --> ProductPage

    ProductPage[Product Detail Page]

    ProductPage --> VariantSelection
    ProductPage --> InventoryStatus
    ProductPage --> ProductImages

    VariantSelection[Variant Selection]
    InventoryStatus[Inventory Visibility]
    ProductImages[Optimized Images]

    ProductImages --> S3

    %% =====================================
    %% UPDATE FLOW
    %% =====================================

    Admin --> ProductUpdate

    ProductUpdate[Product Update]

    ProductUpdate --> MySQL

    ProductUpdate --> CacheInvalidation

    CacheInvalidation[Cache Invalidation]

    CacheInvalidation --> Redis

    Redis --> RefreshedCache

    RefreshedCache[Fresh Product Cache]